---
const steps = [
  {
    title: 'You send us the finding',
    body: 'We take a read-only look and tell you what we’d change.',
  },
  {
    title: 'We build the fix',
    body: 'In a safe copy of your setup, never on your live systems.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Your team approves it',
    body: 'You decide when it goes live, and keep the record for your auditor.',
  },
];
---

<section class="center">
  <div class="wrap col">
    <span class="eyebrow">How a fix happens</span>
    <h2>From a failing control to a <span class="accent">signed-off fix</span></h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Say your platform flags that admins can edit your audit logs. Usually that sits in
      the backlog for months. Here's what we do with it.
    </p>
    <ol class="flow">
      {steps.map((s, i) => (
        <>
          {i > 0 && (
            <svg class="arrow" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 L19 12"></path><path d="M13 6 L19 12 L13 18"></path></svg>
          )}
          <li class={`node${i === 1 ? ' hot' : ''}`}>
            <span class="serif num">{i + 1}</span>
            <strong>{s.title}</strong>
            <span class="body">{s.body}</span>
          </li>
        </>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-align: center; }
  .lede { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .flow { list-style: none; display: flex; align-items: stretch; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; align-self: stretch; }
  .node {
    flex: 1; max-width: 360px; text-align: left;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 30px; background: var(--surface);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  }
  .num { font-size: 22px; font-style: italic; color: var(--accent-text); }
  .node strong { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; }
  .node .body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); }
  .node.hot { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-tint); }
  .arrow { margin: 0 12px; flex: none; align-self: center; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .flow { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .node { max-width: 520px; width: 100%; }
    .arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); margin: 4px 0; }
  }
</style>
